{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26188","headline":"玉声如乐 · 刘轲","name":"玉声如乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉叩能旋止，人言与乐并。\n繁音忽已阕，雅韵诎然清。\n佩想停仙步，泉疑咽夜声。\n曲终无异听，响极有余情。\n特达知难拟，玲珑岂易名。\n崑山如可得，一片伫爲荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘轲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}